      "In a pan heat ghee and add wadi, fry it until golden brown in hot ghee.",
      "Now remove and keep aside and let it cool down a little. Then put in a grinder jar and grind it into a fine powder. Keep aside for further use.",
      "In a kadai heat the ghee again and add ginger, garlic, green or red chilli, onion and saute until translucent.",
      "Now add turmeric powder, asafoetida and sautÃ© for half a minute then add potatoes, water mix and cook it until soft.",
      "Now add the fried wadi powder and cook it on medium heat until thickened.",
      "Then finish with coriander leaves and lemon juice. Serve hot."
